    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "GF Compatibility now uses signed player-facing modifiers instead of FF8's biased stored bytes. The fields show values such as +5, 0, and -10; Vanilla and reference markers use the same format. Lexeditor converts at the save boundary: +5 writes 105 and -10 writes 90. Hidden Edge entered both values, saved them to a temporary project, read the bytes back, and reloaded the same signed display.",
